    "sentence_translations": [
      "(13) I Must Tell Him",
      "",
      "She can see Gao Ming tomorrow. They are going to see a movie together. Leng Xiaoxi is very happy.",
      "She sees Gao Ming’s umbrella and is very happy. She sees the Wechat on her phone and is also very happy.",
      "",
      "At this time, she looks at the student card. The student card … that is her junior’s student card.",
      "With this student card, Leng Xiaoxi can enter Xijing University.",
      "Without this student card, Leng Xiaoxi cannot enter Xijing University.",
      "Gao Ming doesn’t know that she is now working and is no longer a student.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi thinks, “I must tell Gao Ming. Tomorrow! I must tell him tomorrow .”"
    ]
  }
